    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a bonus action, you call upon the light to protect you. For 1 minute, attack rolls against you are made with disadvantage. In addition, once per turn, when a creature missing you with a melee attack, you may deal radiant damage to them equal to 1d6 + half your Paladin level.</p>",
